    {
      "type": "row",
      "title": "Commanded against actual power",
      "id": 8,
      "collapsed": false,
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 1,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 5
      },
      "panels": []
    },
    {
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Battery power: commanded, final plan and actual (W, + charge, - discharge)",
      "id": 9,
      "description": "All three use the service's sign: + charge, - discharge. Final plan: slot_battery_power_watts{plan=final}, the intent frozen at the slot open (+ charge). Actual: actuator_observed_battery_power_watts, the measured battery AC power; the service already negates Home Assistant's sensor.venus_ac_power (+ while discharging), so + is charge here. Commanded is derived from the actuator's request, which is not itself a battery power: in a charge slot the PD target is a grid-IMPORT setpoint (>= 0) equal to house load + planned charge, so charge = PD target - house load (floored at 0); in a discharge slot the request is the system discharge cap, drawn as - cap (a ceiling: the battery delivers less when the house needs less); idle is 0. The house load is the estimate at the scrape (grid - battery power), not at the tick, so the charge level is approximate. Commanded has data in dry_run and live only.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${datasource}"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 9,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 6
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${datasource}"
          },
          "editorMode": "code",
          "expr": "max(battery_optimizer_actuator_desired_allow_charge) * clamp_min(max(battery_optimizer_actuator_desired_pd_target_watts) - max(battery_optimizer_actuator_house_load_watts), 0) - max(battery_optimizer_actuator_desired_allow_discharge) * (max(battery_optimizer_actuator_desired_max_discharge_watts) or on() vector(0))",
          "legendFormat": "Commanded",
          "refId": "A"
        },
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${datasource}"
          },
          "editorMode": "code",
          "expr": "max(battery_optimizer_slot_battery_power_watts{plan=\"final\"})",
          "legendFormat": "Final plan",
          "refId": "B"
        },
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${datasource}"
          },
          "editorMode": "code",
          "expr": "max(battery_optimizer_actuator_observed_battery_power_watts)",
          "legendFormat": "Actual",
          "refId": "C"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "watt",
          "custom": {
            "drawStyle": "line",
            "lineWidth": 1,
            "fillOpacity": 0,
            "showPoints": "never",
            "spanNulls": false,
            "lineInterpolation": "stepAfter",
            "stacking": {
              "mode": "none",
              "group": "A"
            }
          }
        },
        "overrides": [
          {
            "matcher": {
              "id": "byName",
              "options": "Commanded"
            },
            "properties": [
              {
                "id": "color",
                "value": {
                  "mode": "fixed",
                  "fixedColor": "purple"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "matcher": {
              "id": "byName",
              "options": "Final plan"
            },
            "properties": [
              {
                "id": "color",
                "value": {
                  "mode": "fixed",
                  "fixedColor": "orange"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "matcher": {
              "id": "byName",
              "options": "Actual"
            },
            "properties": [
              {
                "id": "color",
                "value": {
                  "mode": "fixed",
                  "fixedColor": "green"
                }
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "showLegend": true
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi",
          "sort": "desc"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "PD grid-import target: requested and observed (W, import, never negative)",
      "id": 10,
      "description": "The raw actuator request. Requested: actuator_desired_pd_target_watts. Observed: actuator_observed_pd_target_watts, the number as Home Assistant reports it. They should be equal after a write; a difference is a write that did not land or an entity that cuts the value. This is a grid-import setpoint (house load + charge power when charging, a small margin when discharging, the neutral value when idle), not a battery power: do not compare it with the power panel above. The estimated house load (grid - battery AC power) is shown for reference.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${datasource}"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 15
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${datasource}"
          },
          "editorMode": "code",
          "expr": "max(battery_optimizer_actuator_desired_pd_target_watts)",
          "legendFormat": "Requested",
          "refId": "A"
        },
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${datasource}"
          },
          "editorMode": "code",
          "expr": "max(battery_optimizer_actuator_observed_pd_target_watts)",
          "legendFormat": "Observed",
          "refId": "B"
        },
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${datasource}"
          },
          "editorMode": "code",
          "expr": "max(battery_optimizer_actuator_house_load_watts)",
          "legendFormat": "House load (estimate)",
          "refId": "C"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "watt",
          "custom": {
            "drawStyle": "line",
            "lineWidth": 1,
            "fillOpacity": 0,
            "showPoints": "never",
            "spanNulls": false,
            "lineInterpolation": "stepAfter",
            "stacking": {
              "mode": "none",
              "group": "A"
            }
          }
        },
        "overrides": [
          {
            "matcher": {
              "id": "byName",
              "options": "Requested"
            },
            "properties": [
              {
                "id": "color",
                "value": {
                  "mode": "fixed",
                  "fixedColor": "orange"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "matcher": {
              "id": "byName",
              "options": "Observed"
            },
            "properties": [
              {
                "id": "color",
                "value": {
                  "mode": "fixed",
                  "fixedColor": "green"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "matcher": {
              "id": "byName",
              "options": "House load (estimate)"
            },
            "properties": [
              {
                "id": "color",
                "value": {
                  "mode": "fixed",
                  "fixedColor": "text"
                }
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "showLegend": true
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi",
          "sort": "desc"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "System discharge cap requested (W)",
      "id": 11,
      "description": "actuator_desired_max_discharge_watts: the system discharge cap the actuator asked for. It exists only in discharge slots (a gap elsewhere, never a 0).",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
