      "title": "Energy clipped by the replay (kWh, rolling 24 h)",
      "id": 14,
      "description": "increase(shadow_clipped_energy_kwh_total[1d]): requested energy the shadow replay had to clip (SOC window, power, import ceiling, no export). This is the replay's clipping, not the real battery's.",
